    <title>Fruit Attraction 2026: The Festival of Fresh Connections, Attractive Technologies and Fruitful Opportunities</title>
    <link href="https://marynakuzmenko.com/insights/fruit-attraction-2026/" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <id>https://marynakuzmenko.com/insights/fruit-attraction-2026/</id>
    <published>2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z</published>
    <updated>2026-10-10T14:26:45.000Z</updated>
    <summary>Field notes from Fruit Attraction in Madrid: generative AI in the packhouse office, sensors everywhere, visual quality control, drones and robots for IPM, RFID traceability, and the human experience no AI can replace.</summary>
    <category term="FruitAttraction"/>
    <category term="AIinAgriculture"/>
    <category term="AgriTech"/>
    <content type="html" xml:base="https://marynakuzmenko.com/insights/fruit-attraction-2026/">

&lt;p class=&quot;post-intro&quot;&gt;Do you know the real name of Fruit Attraction? 🍎🫐🍓&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It&#39;s the Festival of Fresh Connections, Attractive Technologies, and Fruitful Opportunities :)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Plus DJ music, palms, old and new friends, and mind-blowing stand designs (I recorded some of them, I&#39;ll show you 😉)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;photo-grid photo-grid--portrait&quot;&gt;
  
&lt;figure class=&quot;page-figure&quot;&gt;
  &lt;img
    src=&quot;/assets/img/events/2026-10-08-Fruit-Attraction/fruit-pillar-stand-fruit-attraction-2026-640.webp&quot;
    srcset=&quot;/assets/img/events/2026-10-08-Fruit-Attraction/fruit-pillar-stand-fruit-attraction-2026-480.webp 480w, /assets/img/events/2026-10-08-Fruit-Attraction/fruit-pillar-stand-fruit-attraction-2026-640.webp 640w&quot;
    sizes=&quot;(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 330px&quot;
    width=&quot;640&quot;
    height=&quot;1422&quot;
    alt=&quot;A tall pillar built entirely of fresh fruit: pineapples, dragon fruit, melons, grapes and leaves, stacked from floor to ceiling.&quot;
    loading=&quot;lazy&quot;
    decoding=&quot;async&quot;&gt;
  
  
  
  &lt;figcaption&gt;A pillar of fresh fruit on a stand.&lt;/figcaption&gt;
  
&lt;/figure&gt;

  
&lt;figure class=&quot;page-figure&quot;&gt;
  &lt;img
    src=&quot;/assets/img/events/2026-10-08-Fruit-Attraction/mushrooms-on-log-stand-fruit-attraction-2026-640.webp&quot;
    srcset=&quot;/assets/img/events/2026-10-08-Fruit-Attraction/mushrooms-on-log-stand-fruit-attraction-2026-480.webp 480w, /assets/img/events/2026-10-08-Fruit-Attraction/mushrooms-on-log-stand-fruit-attraction-2026-640.webp 640w&quot;
    sizes=&quot;(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 330px&quot;
    width=&quot;640&quot;
    height=&quot;1422&quot;
    alt=&quot;A cluster of brown mushrooms growing out of a white-coated log, displayed on a stand.&quot;
    loading=&quot;lazy&quot;
    decoding=&quot;async&quot;&gt;
  
  
  
  &lt;figcaption&gt;Mushrooms growing on a log, on a produce display.&lt;/figcaption&gt;
  
&lt;/figure&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;And as a bonus, Fruit Attraction is also kind of a fashion show (especially female business style 😍). But since we are here for a different purpose, let&#39;s talk about technologies.&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;figure class=&quot;page-figure&quot;&gt;
  &lt;img
    src=&quot;/assets/img/events/2026-10-08-Fruit-Attraction/maryna-kuzmenko-juliana-bolanos-castro-ifema-madrid-2026-1200.webp&quot;
    srcset=&quot;/assets/img/events/2026-10-08-Fruit-Attraction/maryna-kuzmenko-juliana-bolanos-castro-ifema-madrid-2026-480.webp 480w, /assets/img/events/2026-10-08-Fruit-Attraction/maryna-kuzmenko-juliana-bolanos-castro-ifema-madrid-2026-1200.webp 1200w&quot;
    sizes=&quot;(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 860px&quot;
    width=&quot;1200&quot;
    height=&quot;900&quot;
    alt=&quot;Dr. Maryna Kuzmenko and Juliana Bolanos Castro standing in front of the large IFEMA Madrid letters in the exhibition entrance hall.&quot;
    loading=&quot;lazy&quot;
    decoding=&quot;async&quot;&gt;
  
  
  
  &lt;figcaption&gt;Dr. Maryna Kuzmenko with Juliana Bolaños Castro at IFEMA Madrid.&lt;/figcaption&gt;
  
&lt;/figure&gt;


&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;num&quot;&gt;1.&lt;/span&gt; AI in offices&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The main point is AI in offices: processing warehouse documents, forms, reports, etc. It&#39;s built on Generative AI, the strongest AI capability right now. It&#39;s great to see service providers filling this niche for fresh produce 🚀&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;figure class=&quot;page-figure page-figure--portrait&quot;&gt;
  &lt;img
    src=&quot;/assets/img/events/2026-10-08-Fruit-Attraction/maryna-kuzmenko-kacper-dach-agro-contracts-fruit-attraction-2026-640.webp&quot;
    srcset=&quot;/assets/img/events/2026-10-08-Fruit-Attraction/maryna-kuzmenko-kacper-dach-agro-contracts-fruit-attraction-2026-480.webp 480w, /assets/img/events/2026-10-08-Fruit-Attraction/maryna-kuzmenko-kacper-dach-agro-contracts-fruit-attraction-2026-640.webp 640w&quot;
    sizes=&quot;(max-width: 520px) 100vw, 420px&quot;
    width=&quot;640&quot;
    height=&quot;1422&quot;
    alt=&quot;Dr. Maryna Kuzmenko and Kacper Dach standing beside a stand on a pink carpet, with a display screen behind them.&quot;
    loading=&quot;lazy&quot;
    decoding=&quot;async&quot;&gt;
  
  
  
  &lt;figcaption&gt;Dr. Maryna Kuzmenko with Kacper Dach from Agro Contracts.&lt;/figcaption&gt;
  
&lt;/figure&gt;


&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;num&quot;&gt;2.&lt;/span&gt; Sensors are everywhere&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Good news: more AI in fields, orchards and greenhouses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;post-steps&quot;&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weather stations:&lt;/strong&gt; I lost count, it&#39;s already kind of a commodity.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Irrigation &amp;amp; soil sensors:&lt;/strong&gt; often together with weather stations.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Image sensors:&lt;/strong&gt; a few industrial-level cameras (looked pretty like IP65). But most providers in yield forecasting, computer vision &amp;amp; quality control don&#39;t invent cameras. They use market hardware &amp;amp; optimise the software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;num&quot;&gt;3.&lt;/span&gt; Visual AI for quality control&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Since we&#39;re on quality control already: several companies offer the same product, visual AI for fresh produce. The scheme is the same; the difference is in price (VC-backed ones ask more), accuracy (hugely depends on how modern your line is), and trust.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So, as usual, please do due diligence before anything serious.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;num&quot;&gt;4.&lt;/span&gt; Biologicals get their own delivery tech&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Biologicals as part of IPM are getting their own delivery tech. Releasing beneficial insects by drone seems to be 4–6 times more effective than manual release.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Additionally, and warmly welcomed for in-field application: robots on legs and on wheels for phytosanitary treatments and weeding. All of them are worth attention and looked ready for a real field trial :)&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;figure class=&quot;page-figure&quot;&gt;
  &lt;img
    src=&quot;/assets/img/events/2026-10-08-Fruit-Attraction/maryna-kuzmenko-marc-jones-antobot-fruit-attraction-2026-1200.webp&quot;
    srcset=&quot;/assets/img/events/2026-10-08-Fruit-Attraction/maryna-kuzmenko-marc-jones-antobot-fruit-attraction-2026-480.webp 480w, /assets/img/events/2026-10-08-Fruit-Attraction/maryna-kuzmenko-marc-jones-antobot-fruit-attraction-2026-1200.webp 1200w&quot;
    sizes=&quot;(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 860px&quot;
    width=&quot;1200&quot;
