    loading=&quot;lazy&quot;
    decoding=&quot;async&quot;&gt;
  
  
  
  &lt;figcaption&gt;A robot arm on the show floor.&lt;/figcaption&gt;
  
&lt;/figure&gt;


&lt;h2&gt;Back to the human experience&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;But to sum up, I want to go back to the human experience.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You definitely need fluent Spanish to get 100% out of the event. However, even with imperfect English you will be understood, welcomed, and sometimes even hugged 🤗&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;figure class=&quot;page-figure&quot;&gt;
  &lt;img
    src=&quot;/assets/img/events/2026-10-08-Fruit-Attraction/maryna-kuzmenko-volodymyr-pechko-ukrsadvinprom-fruit-attraction-2026-1200.webp&quot;
    srcset=&quot;/assets/img/events/2026-10-08-Fruit-Attraction/maryna-kuzmenko-volodymyr-pechko-ukrsadvinprom-fruit-attraction-2026-480.webp 480w, /assets/img/events/2026-10-08-Fruit-Attraction/maryna-kuzmenko-volodymyr-pechko-ukrsadvinprom-fruit-attraction-2026-1200.webp 1200w&quot;
    sizes=&quot;(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 860px&quot;
    width=&quot;1200&quot;
    height=&quot;675&quot;
    alt=&quot;Dr. Maryna Kuzmenko in a selfie with Volodymyr Pechko in front of the Ukraine national stand at Fruit Attraction.&quot;
    loading=&quot;lazy&quot;
    decoding=&quot;async&quot;&gt;
  
  
  
  &lt;figcaption&gt;Dr. Maryna Kuzmenko with Volodymyr Pechko, Head of Ukrsadvinprom, at the Ukraine stand.&lt;/figcaption&gt;
  
&lt;/figure&gt;


&lt;div class=&quot;post-callout&quot;&gt;
  &lt;h2&gt;And please, don&#39;t be scared with AI&lt;/h2&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;It cannot replace all of THAT feelings and belonging to this place.&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;However, currently AI is the topic everyone wanted to speak about at Fruit Attraction 💚&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;


