&lt;/figure&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;num&quot;&gt;4.&lt;/span&gt; Who owns the data?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Farmers run mixed fleets of different brands, so interoperability and &quot;who owns the data?&quot; come up every time. From my own experience: in most cases your tech is co-existing with the tech zoo already deployed on the farm.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;num&quot;&gt;5.&lt;/span&gt; Britain is still a bit British about it&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And on AI in UK agriculture: Britain is still a bit British about it (from the stage, not from me :)&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;figure class=&quot;page-figure&quot;&gt;
  &lt;img
    src=&quot;/assets/img/events/2026-09-23-WATIS-2/elliott-grant-panel-speakers-world-agri-tech-london-2026-1200.webp&quot;
