  &lt;figcaption&gt;Dr. Maryna Kuzmenko with Belinda Clarke from Agri-TechE.&lt;/figcaption&gt;
  
&lt;/figure&gt;


&lt;h2&gt;The second feeling: a healthy alarm&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So, the excited part is finished. Now the second, healthy feeling. Not fear, but inner alarm about the risks of AI.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You know that feeling when you meet a person with amazing depth of knowledge and unbelievable speed of work... but their emotional intelligence is still in its infancy? You don&#39;t know how to behave with that person...&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Three scenarios if something goes wrong with AI (Geoffrey Hinton, the godfather of AI, said this, I&#39;m just repeating):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;post-steps&quot;&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Bad guys use AI on purpose &amp;amp; create new global biological risks.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Smart, good guys use it inaccurately and create something not in the plan (negligence; check the Hugging Face incident, brilliantly explained by Elliott 🤗).&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;AI becomes smarter than us and decides it doesn&#39;t need humans anymore.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;photo-grid&quot;&gt;
  
&lt;figure class=&quot;page-figure&quot;&gt;
  &lt;img
    src=&quot;/assets/img/events/2026-09-23-WATIS-2/elliott-grant-agentic-era-slide-world-agri-tech-2026-1200.webp&quot;
