&lt;figure class=&quot;page-figure&quot;&gt;
  &lt;img
    src=&quot;/assets/img/events/2026-09-23-WATIS-2/elliott-grant-agentic-ai-ready-slide-world-agri-tech-2026-1200.webp&quot;
    srcset=&quot;/assets/img/events/2026-09-23-WATIS-2/elliott-grant-agentic-ai-ready-slide-world-agri-tech-2026-480.webp 480w, /assets/img/events/2026-09-23-WATIS-2/elliott-grant-agentic-ai-ready-slide-world-agri-tech-2026-1200.webp 1200w&quot;
    sizes=&quot;(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 410px&quot;
    width=&quot;1200&quot;
    height=&quot;900&quot;
    alt=&quot;A screen showing a slide titled Getting your Org Agentic AI-ready, with a checklist beside a cartoon farmer in sunglasses standing in a green field, captioned Dr Elliott Grant, Agentic AI is Coming to Food and Agriculture, Are you Ready?&quot;
    loading=&quot;lazy&quot;
    decoding=&quot;async&quot;&gt;
  
  
  
  &lt;figcaption&gt;From Dr Elliott Grant&amp;#39;s workshop: getting your organisation agentic-AI-ready.&lt;/figcaption&gt;
  
&lt;/figure&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;So what to do? As usual, don&#39;t panic :)&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Be aware of the risks, but focus on your own universe, your best farm or agrifood production.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Be aware of the risks, but keep moving forward with AI step by step.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;More people want AI for good: productivity, less routine, easier lives for growers.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;There is huge progress in good AI with vibe coding, 3D printing and GenAI, even in business pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;In the last month alone I&#39;ve seen at least a dozen GitHub repositories where someone builds physical AI just for fun, but with obvious commercial potential. So, let&#39;s not be scared, but aware.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;You are not alone, we are all in this unclear time together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;figure class=&quot;page-figure&quot;&gt;
