  &lt;h2&gt;The only absolutely clear thing&lt;/h2&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;The era of permissionless AI innovation in agriculture is happening right here, right now 🚀&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;And I felt it at World Agri-Tech 💚&lt;/p&gt;
