&lt;h2&gt;So, what is actually slowing agritech down?&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It&#39;s clear that with the power of AI + tech today, invention is not the problem. Data is not an issue either.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adoption is.&lt;/strong&gt; Trials, regulation, finance and trust.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;By the way, AI in agriculture was Day 2.&lt;/p&gt;

